<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#ff6500"><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"><title>Connected Apps · Classic Mart</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/role-dashboard.css"></head><body><main class="role-main"><div class="role-shell"><section class="role-content"><div class="page-heading role-page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Account security</span><h1>Connected Apps</h1><p>Review mobile sessions, installed-app access and push devices. Revocation is immediate on the server.</p></div><a class="outline-button" href="/account/security">Back to security</a></div><section class="panel role-focus-panel"><div class="role-panel-head"><div><h2>Install Classic Mart</h2><p>The PWA uses the same live server data and never caches trusted payment or stock state.</p></div></div><button class="primary-button" data-pwa-install type="button" hidden>Install Classic Mart</button><a class="outline-button" href="/app">Open app view</a></section><section class="panel role-form-section"><div class="role-panel-head"><div><h2>Mobile sessions</h2><p>Native/API clients use rotating opaque tokens. Revoke anything you do not recognize.</p></div></div><div class="catalogue-stack"><% mobileSessions.forEach(session => { %><article class="catalog-row"><div><strong><%= session.deviceName %></strong><small><%= session.platform %> · last used <%= formatDate(session.lastUsedAt || session.createdAt) %></small></div><div><span class="role-status <%= session.revokedAt ? 'neutral' : 'good' %>"><%= session.revokedAt ? 'revoked' : 'active' %></span><% if(!session.revokedAt){%><form method="post" action="/account/apps/<%=session.publicId%>/revoke"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%=csrfToken%>"><button class="outline-button" type="submit">Revoke</button></form><%}%></div></article><% }) %><% if(!mobileSessions.length){%><p class="catalogue-empty">No mobile API sessions are connected.</p><%}%></div></section><section class="panel role-form-section"><div class="role-panel-head"><div><h2>Push devices</h2><p>Registered devices can be removed independently of sign-in sessions.</p></div></div><div class="catalogue-stack"><% pushDevices.forEach(device => { %><article class="catalog-row"><div><strong><%= device.label || device.platform %></strong><small><%= device.platform %> · <%= device.status %></small></div><% if(device.status==='active'){%><form method="post" action="/account/push-devices/<%=device.publicId%>/revoke"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%=csrfToken%>"><button class="outline-button" type="submit">Revoke</button></form><%}%></article><% }) %><% if(!pushDevices.length){%><p class="catalogue-empty">No push devices registered.</p><%}%></div></section></section></div></main><script src="/pwa.js"></script></body></html>
